### Variables
@apiKey = your-api-key-here
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### Health Check
# Note: No authentication required for health checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###############################################################################
### SIGNATURE COMPARISON ENDPOINTS
###############################################################################

### Compare Signatures - Complete Valid Request
# Note: You need to replace the file paths with actual image files
# Files should be: valid_id.jpg, specimen_signatures.jpg, selfie_with_id.jpg
#
# Signature Extraction:
# - If AZURE_DI_ENDPOINT and AZURE_DI_KEY are configured, uses Azure Document Intelligence
# - Otherwise, falls back to OpenCV contour detection
# - Feature extraction and comparison always done locally (no external API calls)
POST {{baseUrl}}/compare_signatures
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="valid_id"; filename="valid_id.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testdata/valid_id.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="specimen_signatures"; filename="specimen_signatures.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testdata/specimen_signatures.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="selfie_with_id"; filename="selfie_with_id.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testdata/selfie_with_id.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

