### GPT Signature Deduplication
### ============================================

### GPT Dedup - Basic Request (Select cleanest signature from opencv_signatures)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gpt_dedup
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "opencv_signatures": [
    {
      "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANS..."
    },
    {
      "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANS..."
    }
  ]
}

### GPT Dedup - Single Signature (No GPT call needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gpt_dedup
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "opencv_signatures": [
    {
      "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANS..."
    }
  ]
}

